%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI'm a failure of a teacher!\d%K%P
「老娘我已经、干不了教师了啊～！」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...Hahh.\d%K%P
「………哈啊」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI actually ended up screaming at my student... And I said\nso many awful things...\d%K%P
「学生居然对我怒吼…\n还对我说了那么过分的话…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dHey... Another bottle over here, yeah?\d%K%P
「啊～，这个再来一杯」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAnd it wasn't related to education or any sort of moral\nguidance. Fighting over a man... I can't believe it...\d%K%P
「而且，并不是因为教育指导上的问题，\n而是因为纯粹的私人原因…\n为了一个男人而吵架…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dOh, and more of those assorted cheeses, too.\d%K%P
「啊，加一份奶酪拼盘」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI ended up completely ruining my relationship with a\nstudent I worked so hard to help...\d%K%P
「而且，和美都子…\n那么费尽心血教导的学生决裂了…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dWhere the hell is the princess, anyway...\n...I wonder if she saw through me when we talked over the\nphone.\d%K%P
「太迟了啊，公主。\n…你没有看出这边的状况吗？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dHey! Are you even listening to me?!\d%K%P
「喂，你在听我说话吗！？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dLike it'd even matter if I were, considering that's the\nfifth time in a row you've been nattering on about it.\d%K%P
「听没听先不提，\n从刚刚开始，这已经是第５次了」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dHaaaaahh... That's it, I'm done. Somebody save me... I\ndon't even care who! Anybody goes!\d%K%P
「哈啊啊啊啊～、我已经不行了。\n谁来帮帮我啊。谁都可以啊」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI think it'd help if that \danybody\d was a guy other than\nOsamu, you know.\d%K%P
「再找个男人不就得了？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dPardon me, I'd like another glass.\d%K%P
「抱歉，再来一杯」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dHey, are you even listening to me?\d%K%P
「喂，你在听我说话么？」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAaaaaahh... I'm a failure of a teacher!\d%K%P
「啊啊啊啊啊～\n老娘我已经、干不了教师了啊～！」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dAnd here comes number six...\d%K%P
「第６次…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI need to report this to the principal...\nI dread to imagine how he'll take it..\d%K%P
「必须得告诉教导主任了。\n我会受到什么处分呢…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI think it'd just cause that poor guy grief if you\nstarted reporting lovers' quarrels to him, though...\d%K%P
「就算你把这种争风吃醋的吵架告诉教导主任，\n他也会不好办的…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWhat if I get the sack for this...\d%K%P
「说不定我会就此失业…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI guess you'd be Mr. and Mrs. Laid-off, then.\d%K%P
「那夫妇就是『失业大哥大姐』了吧」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dSeriously, though! What am I supposed to do if that\n-does- happen? I'm not qualified for any other line of\nwork!\d%K%P
「呐，要是真发展到那种地步，我该怎么好呢？\n我除了教师这个职业，别无去路啊…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dYou could always try a pub. It worked for Ms. Landlord's\nmom.\d%K%P
「到酒馆去工作如何？\n就像房东小姐她妈一样」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWould Osamu come to my shop like he did with Mitoko's\nmother?\d%K%P
「那样的话，\n理会到店里去吗？\n就像美都子她妈妈在的那时一样」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dAs if him just coming to your shop would be enough for\nyou.\d%K%P
「他要是去了，你能接受？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...Hahh.\d%K%P
「………哈啊啊啊啊～」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dJesus, you're hopeless. And to think that I, of all\npeople, would be saying that to someone...\d%K%P
「你这个没用老娘儿们…\n和我已经白话很多了吧？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYou're right, I really am hopeless...\nWhy did it have to come to this?\d%K%P
「我，真是个没用的老娘儿们…\n可我该怎么办呢」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dBesides, if you're so obsessed with him, why'd you split\nup over something like not being able to have kids,\nanyway?\d%K%P
「再说了，\n你都这么执着于人家了，\n为什么因为生不了孩子，就和他离婚了呢？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dThat was just, well... It was kind of on a whim...\d%K%P
「那时候，一时糊涂…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dIs that an actual hint of regret I'm hearing?\d%K%P
「你不会是，后悔了吧？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dC-Come on, this is hardly the time to be discussing my\npast...\d%K%P
「现、现在不是倒弄陈年旧账的时候吧」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...So you -do- regret it.\d%K%P
「…是你在倒弄吧」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWh-What was I supposed to do?! Osamu needed someone he\ncould shower with unconditional love. He grew up in a\nfamily that had none of it...\d%K%P
「但、但那也没办法吧！\n对理来说，必须得有一个赌上性命倾注爱情的女人在他身边啊。\n他，没得到多少父母的爱…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dFrom where I stand, it looks like you desperately need\nsomeone to be with and soothe you. I wonder if that's\nbecause you were brought up in a loving family.\d%K%P
「可是，如今的老师，\n看起来必须得有一个在一起能安心的对象吧？\n是因为父母的爱太多了吗？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI can't ruin Osamu's life because of my selfishness. A\nwoman who can't even bear children is nothing but a\nburden.\d%K%P
「不能因为我的任性而扰乱理的人生。\n不能生育的女人，对他来说，包袱太沉重了…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...And with that on your mind, you divorced him, and his\nlife actually -did- fall apart, didn't it?\d%K%P
「…可是你们离婚了，\n理君的人生反而乱了啊」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWhy do things always turn out like this...? I'm a failure\nof a woman...\d%K%P
「真是的，为什么变成这样了啊…\n老娘我真是、当不成女人了啊」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dThat's quite an increase in scope there.\d%K%P
「怎么越来越严重了啊」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dHahh...\d%K%P
「哈啊啊啊啊～」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dAnd yet, you always act so cool and collected in front of\nOsamu.\d%K%P
「为什么你总是在他面前，装作一副女强人的模样啊」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI can't help putting up a front with him. I was the one\nwho wanted the divorce, so it'd be even worse if I made\nhim start worrying about me.\d%K%P
「渐渐地就控制不住要逞强了嘛。\n是我主动提出分手的，不能让他担心吧」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI'm sure Osamu has a completely different idea about you,\nTeach. To him, you're probably a strong, independent woman\nwhose kindness is unrivaled and unconditional, like that\nof a saint.\d%K%P
「理君，绝对是误会了老师吧？\n虽然是个坚强自立的女强人，\n但实际上是个温柔贤良的圣母」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWell... I can't deny that it's nice to be thought of that\nway...\d%K%P
「因为…\n他能这么想，我就很开心啊…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dIf only you'd told him how you really felt, the two of\nyou wouldn't have needed to break up.\d%K%P
「你要是能多真心依赖一下他，\n你们就不会分手了吧？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWhat was I supposed to do? Osamu needed someone he could\nshower with unconditional love...\d%K%P
「没办法啊。\n对理来说，需要一个赌上性命倾注爱情的…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dAnd here we go again...\d%K%P
「又来了啊…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI'm a failure of a human being...\d%K%P
「老娘我已经、做不了人了啊…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dJesus, princess, hurry it up...\nI dunno how much longer I can take this...\d%K%P
「快来吧，公主…\n我投降了，真是的」%K%P
